    "detailed_description": "Fight tons of robots, upgrade your abilities and explore an abandoned artificial planet with your jetpack in this non-linear shoot'em up adventure! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/7df1233ba376da3b2c63cc160b8e99f8.poster.avif?t=1694707984\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/7df1233ba376da3b2c63cc160b8e99f8.webm?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/7df1233ba376da3b2c63cc160b8e99f8.mp4?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Set in the distant future, play as Gabriela Xanchez, an historian working for the galactic government, sent to investigate the remains of an old industrial planet and retrieve a misterious artifact: the last paper book in existance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/3ac2a6ad47e76c7b65864d3e6cc6dca6.poster.avif?t=1694707984\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/3ac2a6ad47e76c7b65864d3e6cc6dca6.webm?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/3ac2a6ad47e76c7b65864d3e6cc6dca6.mp4?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast paced combat with tons of different enemies: The security systems are no longer working properly and will shoot any intruder on sight, including you!<br></li><li> A non-linear world to explore from the start: No powerups or keys required to reach any area, only your skills against an army of heavily armed robots.<br></li><li> Different environments with specific obstacles and challenges: Make sure to explore and find upgrades to your armor and missile launcher.<br></li><li> Collect a modest but strong selection of modifiers: Equip them to improve your chances in combat!<br></li><li> Meet the peculiar characters that still inhabit the planet: Complete sidequests and help them leave the planet with you to avoid its impending destruction.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Fight tons of robots, upgrade your abilities and explore an abandoned artificial planet with your jetpack in this non-linear shoot'em up adventure! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/7df1233ba376da3b2c63cc160b8e99f8.poster.avif?t=1694707984\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/7df1233ba376da3b2c63cc160b8e99f8.webm?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/7df1233ba376da3b2c63cc160b8e99f8.mp4?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Set in the distant future, play as Gabriela Xanchez, an historian working for the galactic government, sent to investigate the remains of an old industrial planet and retrieve a misterious artifact: the last paper book in existance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/3ac2a6ad47e76c7b65864d3e6cc6dca6.poster.avif?t=1694707984\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/3ac2a6ad47e76c7b65864d3e6cc6dca6.webm?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602080/extras/3ac2a6ad47e76c7b65864d3e6cc6dca6.mp4?t=1694707984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast paced combat with tons of different enemies: The security systems are no longer working properly and will shoot any intruder on sight, including you!<br></li><li> A non-linear world to explore from the start: No powerups or keys required to reach any area, only your skills against an army of heavily armed robots.<br></li><li> Different environments with specific obstacles and challenges: Make sure to explore and find upgrades to your armor and missile launcher.<br></li><li> Collect a modest but strong selection of modifiers: Equip them to improve your chances in combat!<br></li><li> Meet the peculiar characters that still inhabit the planet: Complete sidequests and help them leave the planet with you to avoid its impending destruction.</li></ul>",
